    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d306-a3">

                <pb facs="0795" n="1425" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v2/pg1425"/>

                <p>In sequel to the note of this department, of 30th of last month, the ministry for
                    foreign affairs has the honor to inform Mr. Bonar, &amp;c., that as regards the
                    nationality of illegitimate children born in this country of alien parents the
                    laws in force in the lands belonging to the Hungarian Crown are identical with
                    those of the western portion of the Anstro-Hungarian monarchy.</p>
                <p>The undersigned avails, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>BIEGELEBEN.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1868-12-20"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 20,
                        1868</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
